:"The series underclassman who is also the student council president."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is very reliable and gets the job done with precision and without hesitation. She is the only first year student to be elected to the student council in school history but she handles student council business by herself as she has been unable to recruit other students to join the student council. Hidekazu meets her while she is monitoring for tardy students."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Denpasoft Newsletter"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c68497"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/29/29ca009e6285be559b23215e379eb6d46b8aec7332e2efb889e9ce02c7ec208a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/06/06f5c6b250b84e8a450db590480acd4e15b8220707fb38dc5864651776c89f47.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"藍沢 夏癒","creatorId":"vndb:s3233","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3233","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3233","name":"藍沢 夏癒","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:71178","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c68498","characterName":"音々川 色羽","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c68498"},"originalCharacterName":"音々川 色羽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The mysterious upperclassman who loves to read books."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her words and actions reflect her quiet and calm mood. She loves books and often times after school or during lunch, she can be found in the library or the courtyard reading. She is a fan of the mascot character, \"Mochi Neko-san\" and always wears a \"Mochi Neko-san\" hoodie. When l